{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>招牌黑松露冬甩+香港限定楊枝甘露！</p><p>日本超人氣冬甩店 Truffle Donut登港</p><p>來自日本鳥取縣的超人氣冬甩店 Truffle Donut，將於8 月1日正式登陸香港，首間分店選址尖沙咀海港城海運大廈！是次香港首店將推出 10 款生冬甩，包括 7 款原創經典系列及 3 款香港限定系列，必定掀起排隊熱潮！</p><p>必食招牌黑松露口味！</p><p>Truffle Donut 每一顆生冬甩均每日新鮮現炸，外層微微酥脆，內裡則呈現輕盈柔軟、近乎入口即化的空氣感。招牌必食黑松露冬甩，剛炸起的溫熱麵糰配上濃郁的松露油及松露鹽，香氣在入口瞬間爆發。</p><p>香港限定：楊枝甘露/榴槤/開心果</p><p>仲有3款香港獨家口味，包括充滿熱帶果香的楊枝甘露；啖啖貓山王榴槤果蓉的榴槤口味；以及港人最愛的開心果口味，用上比利時開心果醬配搭開心果碎，帶出濃郁堅果香氣。</p><p>Truffle Donut 地址：尖沙咀海港城海運大廈地下 OT G03A 號舖�電話： 3582 8241 營業時間：星期一至四 11:00-21:00，星期五至日及公眾假期 11:00-22:00 官方IG：@truffledonut_hongkong</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178513202857481880_7954871836a66f3fd0913b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178513203051434451_17919268876a66f3fed7f91.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178513203216669348_20753873896a66f400be895.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178513203455741519_4581817856a66f402e89c4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178513203622810714_8606677816a66f404e9e29.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178513203845447583_15829004506a66f406d33cf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178513204014916125_3878419916a66f40899fd3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178513204219797672_8100876206a66f40a8d5cc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178513204388535810_16473145936a66f40c6e364.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-27T06:19:05.289110+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":565,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}